          "worked": "The taxable income is in the \\$120 001–\\$180 000 bracket.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Excess}&=134559-120000\\\\&=14559\\\\\\text{Tax payable}&=29467+0.37\\times14559\\\\&=\\$34853.83\\end{align*}$$",
